            <ArticleTitle>Acute pancreatitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>249-57</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper provides a review of recent advances in the understanding and management of acute pancreatitis. The mortality of acute severe pancreatitis remains disappointingly high. While there have been relatively few recent advances in the surgical management of acute pancreatitis, several nonsurgical developments appear promising.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
